lice Talin is a central figure in Era of Silence's narrative, navigating the harsh realities of a post-apocalyptic world where civilization struggles to rebuild among ancient ruins and dangerous creatures.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":359},[],"2023-12-15T00:00:00.000Z","Alice Talin, a key character in the post-apocalyptic world of Era of Silence",false,"/images/era-of-silence/art/characters/alice-talin.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/characters/alice-talin",{"title":351,"description":361},"artwork/era-of-silence/characters/alice-talin",[],"character","mZ7RXZpX6g1z2ehm-xfRzrdrHlNn_tX2yqsqH_U8dEI",{"id":372,"title":373,"artist":352,"body":374,"date":360,"description":381,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":382,"game":279,"meta":383,"navigation":124,"path":384,"published":124,"seo":385,"stem":386,"tags":387,"thumbnail":382,"type":369,"__hash__":388},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/characters/alras.md","Era of Silence - Alras",{"type":126,"value":375,"toc":379},[376],[139,377,378],{},"Alras stands as a mysterious presence in the world of Era of Silence, their story intertwined with the secrets of the fallen civilization and the path to humanity's future.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":380},[],"Alras, a mysterious figure in the ruins of Era of Silence's world","/images/era-of-silence/art/characters/alras.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/characters/alras",{"title":373,"description":381},"artwork/era-of-silence/characters/alras",[],"-1VZz9DLeb4KdCxdPkF_McERXrXpEMGiW_yx4GMTSBs",{"id":390,"title":391,"artist":352,"body":392,"date":360,"description":399,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":400,"game":279,"meta":401,"navigation":124,"path":402,"published":124,"seo":403,"stem":404,"tags":405,"thumbnail":400,"type":369,"__hash__":406},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/characters/arina-varan.md","Era of Silence - Arina Varan",{"type":126,"value":393,"toc":397},[394],[139,395,396],{},"Arina Varan embodies the resilience of humanity in Era of Silence, where the pink and purple tones of a dying sun paint the landscape of a world trying to remember what was lost.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":398},[],"Arina Varan, a survivor in the watercolor-styled world of Era of Silence","/images/era-of-silence/art/characters/arina-varan.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/characters/arina-varan",{"title":391,"description":399},"artwork/era-of-silence/characters/arina-varan",[],"CeFbWxntx_00wRJU929COYgWMHEXEhCtBV1LMTfL-PE",{"id":408,"title":409,"artist":352,"body":410,"date":360,"description":417,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":418,"game":279,"meta":419,"navigation":124,"path":420,"published":124,"seo":421,"stem":422,"tags":423,"thumbnail":418,"type":369,"__hash__":424},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/characters/birdie.md","Era of Silence - Birdie",{"type":126,"value":411,"toc":415},[412],[139,413,414],{},"Birdie brings a unique perspective to the world of Era of Silence, where every survivor has their own story of loss and adaptation in the face of a transformed world.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":416},[],"Birdie, a distinctive character navigating the post-apocalyptic landscape","/images/era-of-silence/art/characters/birdie.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/characters/birdie",{"title":409,"description":417},"artwork/era-of-silence/characters/birdie",[],"vWkhzCH6dvBVcChA4J5z0gAf8rVHlVKoBxyzJ4p-PF4",{"id":426,"title":427,"artist":352,"body":428,"date":360,"description":435,"extension":268,"featured":124,"fullImage":436,"game":279,"meta":437,"navigation":124,"path":438,"published":124,"seo":439,"stem":440,"tags":441,"thumbnail":436,"type":369,"__hash__":442},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/characters/birdie-augur.md","Era of Silence - Birdie The Augur",{"type":126,"value":429,"toc":433},[430],[139,431,432],{},"Birdie The Augur represents the mystical elements of Era of Silence, where ancient powers and modern desperation collide. This detailed portrait captures the character's connection to forces beyond the physical world, rendered in the game's distinctive watercolor aesthetic.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":434},[],"Detailed artwork of Birdie as The Augur, a mystic figure with the power to see beyond the veil of reality","/images/era-of-silence/art/characters/birdie-the-augur.jpg",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/characters/birdie-augur",{"title":427,"description":435},"artwork/era-of-silence/characters/birdie-augur",[],"p5Za8YA802ewI6z-zFv_QcgyoOUaIX3NgfldjEXSFY8",{"id":444,"title":445,"artist":446,"body":447,"date":454,"description":455,"extension":268,"featured":124,"fullImage":456,"game":279,"meta":457,"navigation":124,"path":458,"published":124,"seo":459,"stem":460,"tags":461,"thumbnail":456,"type":462,"__hash__":465},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/cover.md","Era of Silence Cover","Moss Sugarmountains",{"type":126,"value":448,"toc":452},[449],[139,450,451],{},"The official cover artwork for Era of Silence, capturing the essence of this post-apocalyptic tabletop RPG. The imagery evokes a world of survival, ancient mysteries, and the struggle to rebuild civilization among the ruins of the old world.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":453},[],"2024-01-20T00:00:00.000Z","The cover artwork for Era of Silence tabletop RPG","/images/era-of-silence/sample-pages/cover_front.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/cover",{"title":445,"description":455},"artwork/era-of-silence/cover",[462,463,464],"cover","book","rpg","sFdV4SPSwOSiHtfZyIlDVjv-UYaoygZVhX-pUVKkHoA",{"id":467,"title":468,"artist":352,"body":469,"date":454,"description":476,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":477,"game":279,"meta":478,"navigation":124,"path":479,"published":124,"seo":480,"stem":481,"tags":482,"thumbnail":477,"type":462,"__hash__":483},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/cover-alt.md","Era of Silence Cover (Alternative)",{"type":126,"value":470,"toc":474},[471],[139,472,473],{},"An alternative cover design for Era of Silence, offering a different perspective on the game's themes and setting. This artwork complements the main cover while highlighting unique aspects of the post-apocalyptic world.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":475},[],"Alternative cover artwork for Era of Silence tabletop RPG","/images/era-of-silence/sample-pages/cover-back.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/cover-alt",{"title":468,"description":476},"artwork/era-of-silence/cover-alt",[462,463,464],"x9TF0Fgq83wWISWGiKL0tJCOfWwdEKMkyOibT6KgSrI",{"id":485,"title":486,"artist":352,"body":487,"date":360,"description":494,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":495,"game":279,"meta":496,"navigation":124,"path":497,"published":124,"seo":498,"stem":499,"tags":500,"thumbnail":495,"type":501,"__hash__":502},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/ashcrawler.md","Era of Silence - Ashcrawler",{"type":126,"value":488,"toc":492},[489],[139,490,491],{},"Ashcrawlers are among the most feared predators in the wastes of Era of Silence. These creatures have adapted to thrive in the ash-covered ruins, hunting unwary travelers who venture too far from civilization's protective walls.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":493},[],"The Ashcrawler, a dangerous creature that stalks the ashen wastes of the post-apocalyptic world","/images/era-of-silence/art/creatures/ashcrawler.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/ashcrawler",{"title":486,"description":494},"artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/ashcrawler",[],"creature","O0csFP8_DUtQvL5upIEw8MX-cLoSZEJjnXVGuSeZriE",{"id":504,"title":505,"artist":352,"body":506,"date":360,"description":513,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":514,"game":279,"meta":515,"navigation":124,"path":516,"published":124,"seo":517,"stem":518,"tags":519,"thumbnail":514,"type":501,"__hash__":520},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/bantam-spore.md","Era of Silence - Bantam Spore",{"type":126,"value":507,"toc":511},[508],[139,509,510],{},"Bantam Spores emerged from the biological contamination that followed the apocalypse. These fungal creatures spread their influence across the wasteland, representing the new life that has risen from humanity's fall.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":512},[],"The Bantam Spore, a fungal creature born from the contaminated lands","/images/era-of-silence/art/creatures/bantam-spore.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/bantam-spore",{"title":505,"description":513},"artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/bantam-spore",[],"fuFGQMgVyZkgt8OQxznK1bT0M1EbBGJRjmcoL-xvtsk",{"id":522,"title":523,"artist":352,"body":524,"date":360,"description":531,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":532,"game":279,"meta":533,"navigation":124,"path":534,"published":124,"seo":535,"stem":536,"tags":537,"thumbnail":532,"type":501,"__hash__":538},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/bantam-spore-variant.md","Era of Silence - Bantam Spore Variant",{"type":126,"value":525,"toc":529},[526],[139,527,528],{},"This variant of the Bantam Spore represents the rapid evolution occurring in Era of Silence's contaminated zones. Each generation of these creatures becomes more adapted to the harsh environment and more dangerous to human survivors.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":530},[],"An evolved variant of the Bantam Spore with enhanced abilities and deadlier spore attacks","/images/era-of-silence/art/creatures/bantam-spore-variant.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/bantam-spore-variant",{"title":523,"description":531},"artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/bantam-spore-variant",[],"spxIKxpd40DnGnnttUcbTVUSC65VOVvXEObvLzO7SsA",{"id":540,"title":541,"artist":352,"body":542,"date":360,"description":549,"extension":268,"featured":124,"fullImage":550,"game":279,"meta":551,"navigation":124,"path":552,"published":124,"seo":553,"stem":554,"tags":555,"thumbnail":550,"type":501,"__hash__":556},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/champion.md","Era of Silence - Champion",{"type":126,"value":543,"toc":547},[544],[139,545,546],{},"Champions are elite adversaries in Era of Silence, whether they are mutated humans, augmented warriors, or creatures that have claimed dominance over their territory. Encountering a Champion means facing one of the wasteland's greatest challenges.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":548},[],"The Champion, a formidable enemy that stands between survivors and their goals","/images/era-of-silence/art/creatures/champion.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/champion",{"title":541,"description":549},"artwork/era-of-silence/creatures/champion",[],"Vhv07U35bUDMjAWSX4SdFLs6U7cbUNqczJqcb2CMjrY",{"id":558,"title":559,"artist":352,"body":560,"date":454,"description":567,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":568,"game":279,"meta":569,"navigation":124,"path":570,"published":124,"seo":571,"stem":572,"tags":573,"thumbnail":568,"type":578,"__hash__":579},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/items/arm-augment.md","Arm Augment",{"type":126,"value":561,"toc":565},[562],[139,563,564],{},"This arm augmentation represents the fusion of biological and mechanical engineering in Era of Silence. Designed to enhance strength and precision, these augments are sought after by warriors and laborers alike, though their installation carries significant risks.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":566},[],"A biomechanical arm augmentation enhancing strength and capability","/images/era-of-silence/art/items/arm-augment.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/items/arm-augment",{"title":559,"description":567},"artwork/era-of-silence/items/arm-augment",[574,575,576,577],"augmentation","cybernetics","enhancement","technology","item","PJ-t0UfrzKBUe17WsaTThnXLmSN2vZHh3TytGT0anUg",{"id":581,"title":582,"artist":352,"body":583,"date":454,"description":590,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":591,"game":279,"meta":592,"navigation":124,"path":593,"published":124,"seo":594,"stem":595,"tags":596,"thumbnail":591,"type":578,"__hash__":601},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/items/armor-reference.md","Armor Reference",{"type":126,"value":584,"toc":588},[585],[139,586,587],{},"A comprehensive reference sheet showcasing various armor designs used by survivors and fighters in the post-apocalyptic world. These armor pieces combine salvaged materials with practical design, offering protection against both environmental hazards and combat threats.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":589},[],"Technical reference designs for protective armor in Era of Silence","/images/era-of-silence/art/items/armor-reference.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/items/armor-reference",{"title":582,"description":590},"artwork/era-of-silence/items/armor-reference",[597,598,599,600],"armor","equipment","reference","protection","p6lznvnB4XAiZD_X62h4BgmDyxNJ549rzBx-3zBKcvA",{"id":603,"title":604,"artist":352,"body":605,"date":454,"description":612,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":613,"game":279,"meta":614,"navigation":124,"path":615,"published":124,"seo":616,"stem":617,"tags":618,"thumbnail":613,"type":578,"__hash__":619},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/items/augmented-blue-purple.md","Augmented Blue-Purple",{"type":126,"value":606,"toc":610},[607],[139,608,609],{},"This unique augmentation features distinctive blue and purple elements, suggesting advanced energy systems or specialized functionality. The coloration may indicate power flow, status indicators, or unique materials used in its construction.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":611},[],"A striking augmentation with distinctive blue and purple coloration","/images/era-of-silence/art/items/augmented-blue-purple.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/items/augmented-blue-purple",{"title":604,"description":612},"artwork/era-of-silence/items/augmented-blue-purple",[574,575,576,577],"XJ4QQIPW9yg2iMklNITxFQYZHRuEhwP7gi9ESYjT82E",{"id":621,"title":622,"artist":352,"body":623,"date":454,"description":630,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImag