,"description":670,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":671,"game":279,"meta":672,"navigation":124,"path":673,"published":124,"seo":674,"stem":675,"tags":676,"thumbnail":671,"type":578,"__hash__":679},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/items/bolt-thrower.md","Bolt Thrower",{"type":126,"value":664,"toc":668},[665],[139,666,667],{},"The Bolt Thrower is a formidable weapon combining ancient design principles with scavenged technology. It launches heavy bolts capable of piercing armor and bringing down large creatures, making it a favored weapon among hunters and defenders.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":669},[],"A powerful projectile weapon firing heavy bolts with devastating force","/images/era-of-silence/art/items/bolt-thrower.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/items/bolt-thrower",{"title":662,"description":670},"artwork/era-of-silence/items/bolt-thrower",[638,677,678,598],"ranged","bolt","9_EZeWLkjPmQkegkjYSFuxiJhzFcuC8xe6tdt356njk",{"id":681,"title":682,"artist":352,"body":683,"date":454,"description":690,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":691,"game":279,"meta":692,"navigation":124,"path":693,"published":124,"seo":694,"stem":695,"tags":696,"thumbnail":691,"type":578,"__hash__":697},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/items/bullets-reference.md","Bullets Reference",{"type":126,"value":684,"toc":688},[685],[139,686,687],{},"A detailed reference guide showcasing the variety of ammunition types available in Era of Silence. From standard rounds to specialized ammunition designed for specific threats, this reference illustrates the diversity of ballistic options in the wasteland.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":689},[],"Technical reference sheet showing various ammunition types and specifications","/images/era-of-silence/art/items/bullets-reference.jpg",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/items/bullets-reference",{"title":682,"description":690},"artwork/era-of-silence/items/bullets-reference",[637,599,638,598],"5PX9-5qgE63xbjwPimE0tx22NJfx541Vq0T9LKoHuSM",{"id":699,"title":700,"artist":352,"body":701,"date":360,"description":708,"extension":268,"featured":124,"fullImage":709,"game":279,"meta":710,"navigation":124,"path":711,"published":124,"seo":712,"stem":713,"tags":714,"thumbnail":709,"type":715,"__hash__":716},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/locations/approaching-atharas.md","Era of Silence - Approaching Atharas",{"type":126,"value":702,"toc":706},[703],[139,704,705],{},"Approaching Atharas captures the sense of wonder and danger that defines travel in Era of Silence. The ancient city rises from the wasteland, promising both knowledge and peril to those brave enough to seek its secrets.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":707},[],"The journey toward the ancient city of Atharas, a mysterious destination in the wasteland","/images/era-of-silence/art/locations/approaching-atharas.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/locations/approaching-atharas",{"title":700,"description":708},"artwork/era-of-silence/locations/approaching-atharas",[],"location","B99QalfvLoxwHGKQXvDelSCJZuOwRgSFPa1Ld2LBXC4",{"id":718,"title":719,"artist":352,"body":720,"date":360,"description":727,"extension":268,"featured":124,"fullImage":728,"game":279,"meta":729,"navigation":124,"path":730,"published":124,"seo":731,"stem":732,"tags":733,"thumbnail":728,"type":715,"__hash__":734},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/locations/city-of-rings.md","Era of Silence - City of Rings",{"type":126,"value":721,"toc":725},[722],[139,723,724],{},"The City of Rings stands as a testament to humanity's determination to rebuild after the apocalypse. This breathtaking vista showcases the massive ringed structure against Era of Silence's signature pink and purple sky, blending cyberpunk aesthetics with post-apocalyptic desolation in a watercolor style that defines the game's unique visual identity.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":726},[],"Stunning vista of the cyberpunk City of Rings beneath a pink and purple sky, a beacon of civilization in the post-apocalyptic world","/images/era-of-silence/art/locations/city-of-rings.jpg",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/locations/city-of-rings",{"title":719,"description":727},"artwork/era-of-silence/locations/city-of-rings",[],"7dBYQ-EfDXk2VsWi-maZRhL4P3BHICNExNxTz-UI-z8",{"id":736,"title":737,"artist":352,"body":738,"date":454,"description":745,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":746,"game":279,"meta":747,"navigation":124,"path":748,"published":124,"seo":749,"stem":750,"tags":751,"thumbnail":746,"type":754,"__hash__":756},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/chase-scene.md","Chase Scene",{"type":126,"value":739,"toc":743},[740],[139,741,742],{},"A dramatic chase unfolds across the treacherous terrain of Era of Silence. Vehicles race at breakneck speeds, their drivers pushing salvaged machines to their limits while evading pursuers or closing in on their prey in the harsh wasteland.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":744},[],"An intense pursuit through the dangerous wasteland","/images/era-of-silence/art/scenes/chase-scene.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/chase-scene",{"title":737,"description":745},"artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/chase-scene",[752,753,754,755],"action","chase","scene","combat","u8A66i6qfw34jatNr4P7mGVLvz0Dt5njMwSttLnsxhM",{"id":758,"title":759,"artist":352,"body":760,"date":454,"description":767,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":768,"game":279,"meta":769,"navigation":124,"path":770,"published":124,"seo":771,"stem":772,"tags":773,"thumbnail":768,"type":754,"__hash__":777},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/combat-spellcasters.md","Combat Spellcasters",{"type":126,"value":761,"toc":765},[762],[139,763,764],{},"Spellcasters engage in fierce combat, channeling mysterious energies left over from the ancient world. Their powers represent a dangerous but potent force in Era of Silence, where understanding of the old magic can mean the difference between life and death.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":766},[],"Mystical warriors wielding ancient powers in battle","/images/era-of-silence/art/scenes/combat-spellcasters.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/combat-spellcasters",{"title":759,"description":767},"artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/combat-spellcasters",[755,774,775,754,776],"magic","spellcaster","battle","pUsPvUMkruRa0x1bPxnl77VQwNXx2GuaSJeBaH0gqkk",{"id":779,"title":780,"artist":352,"body":781,"date":454,"description":788,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":789,"game":279,"meta":790,"navigation":124,"path":791,"published":124,"seo":792,"stem":793,"tags":794,"thumbnail":789,"type":754,"__hash__":798},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/healing-wounded.md","Healing the Wounded",{"type":126,"value":782,"toc":786},[783],[139,784,785],{},"In the aftermath of conflict, skilled healers work to save lives using a combination of scavenged medical technology and ancient healing practices. This scene captures the compassion and determination that allows humanity to endure in Era of Silence's harsh world.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":787},[],"A moment of compassion as medics tend to the injured","/images/era-of-silence/art/scenes/healing-wounded.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/healing-wounded",{"title":780,"description":788},"artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/healing-wounded",[795,796,754,797],"healing","medical","survival","2E4grCa_ySkMo0RJ6MwaKYMajl6W4rjQ_bSjdS5JsOU",{"id":800,"title":801,"artist":352,"body":802,"date":454,"description":809,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":810,"game":279,"meta":811,"navigation":124,"path":812,"published":124,"seo":813,"stem":814,"tags":815,"thumbnail":810,"type":754,"__hash__":819},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/hunter-dual-swords.md","Hunter with Dual Swords",{"type":126,"value":803,"toc":807},[804],[139,805,806],{},"A hunter demonstrates exceptional skill with dual swords, weapons that require years of training to master. In close combat, these warriors are devastating, their blades flashing as they face down threats in the dangerous world of Era of Silence.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":808},[],"A skilled warrior wielding twin blades in deadly combat","/images/era-of-silence/art/scenes/hunter-dual-swords.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/hunter-dual-swords",{"title":801,"description":809},"artwork/era-of-silence/scenes/hunter-dual-swords",[816,755,817,754,818],"hunter","warrior","melee","ZVoXmKD7NrIzD5qe1TjXTeRJCHepmseiEPNoAFdUcWY",{"id":821,"title":822,"artist":352,"body":823,"date":454,"description":830,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":831,"game":279,"meta":832,"navigation":124,"path":833,"published":124,"seo":834,"stem":835,"tags":836,"thumbnail":831,"type":837,"__hash__":841},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/vehicles/brass-ship.md","The Brass Ship",{"type":126,"value":824,"toc":828},[825],[139,826,827],{},"The Brass Ship is a remarkable vessel crafted from salvaged materials and ancient technology, designed to traverse the harsh desert landscapes of the post-apocalyptic world. Its gleaming brass hull reflects the unforgiving sun as it cuts through sand dunes and ash wastes.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":829},[],"A magnificent brass vessel that sails the desert wastes of Era of Silence","/images/era-of-silence/art/vehicles/brass-ship.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/vehicles/brass-ship",{"title":822,"description":830},"artwork/era-of-silence/vehicles/brass-ship",[837,838,839,840],"vehicle","transportation","desert","brass","lobZlqjfnHp4cngDNKOL3aDMziBKWr29rveRCT3oaH0",{"id":843,"title":844,"artist":352,"body":845,"date":454,"description":852,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":853,"game":279,"meta":854,"navigation":124,"path":855,"published":124,"seo":856,"stem":857,"tags":858,"thumbnail":853,"type":837,"__hash__":861},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/vehicles/buggy.md","Desert Buggy",{"type":126,"value":846,"toc":850},[847],[139,848,849],{},"This desert buggy represents the practical engineering of Era of Silence's survivors. Built from scavenged parts and reinforced with salvaged armor, it's designed to withstand the harsh conditions of the wasteland while providing speed and maneuverability across treacherous terrain.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":851},[],"A rugged off-road vehicle built for survival in the wasteland","/images/era-of-silence/art/vehicles/buggy.jpg",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/vehicles/buggy",{"title":844,"description":852},"artwork/era-of-silence/vehicles/buggy",[837,859,839,860],"buggy","wasteland","f_yDl4CAjaIUtbKJzSI-fQ3JtuRINie98RhAuNru5jk",{"id":863,"title":864,"artist":352,"body":865,"date":454,"description":872,"extension":268,"featured":362,"fullImage":873,"game":279,"meta":874,"navigation":124,"path":875,"published":124,"seo":876,"stem":877,"tags":878,"thumbnail":873,"type":837,"__hash__":881},"artwork/artwork/era-of-silence/vehicles/courier.md","Courier Vehicle",{"type":126,"value":866,"toc":870},[867],[139,868,869],{},"The Courier Vehicle is purpose-built for speed and reliability, carrying vital supplies and information between scattered settlements. Its reinforced cargo compartments and enhanced suspension system make it ideal for long-distance journeys through hostile terrain.",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":871},[],"A specialized transport vehicle for delivering goods and messages across dangerous territories","/images/era-of-silence/art/vehicles/courier.png",{},"/artwork/era-of-silence/vehicles/courier",{"title":864,"description":872},"artwork/era-of-silence/vehicles/courier",[837,879,838,880],"courier","delivery","j9AIryUk_g9NLXJhUJm_s__l-tL-WBMWfwYmUHdv65A",1761796767599]